冀州","place_name_jianti_auto":"冀州","start_index":60,"tongjian_id":"8d3af0c2-db0e-11ef-8add-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"武邑縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"武邑县","start_index":69,"tongjian_id":"8d3af0c3-db0e-11ef-bb41-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"觀津縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"观津县","start_index":75,"tongjian_id":"8d3af0c4-db0e-11ef-ae3d-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"觀津","place_name_jianti_auto":"观津","start_index":81,"tongjian_id":"8d3af0c5-db0e-11ef-9704-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"信都","place_name_jianti_auto":"信都","start_index":85,"tongjian_id":"8d3af0c6-db0e-11ef-a8be-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"史記正義曰：觀，音館，今魏州觀城縣。余按班志，觀津縣屬信都國。又按隋志，魏州之觀城，舊曰衞國，開皇六年始更名；信都國則隋冀州也。開皇六年置武邑縣，幷得觀津縣地，則觀津猶屬信都也。正義誤矣。觀，古玩翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"史记正义曰：观，音馆，今魏州观城县。余按班志，观津县属信都国。又按隋志，魏州之观城，旧曰衞国，开皇六年始更名；信都国则隋冀州也。开皇六年置武邑县，幷得观津县地，则观津犹属信都也。正义误矣。观，古玩翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":75,"tongjian_id":"8d3af0b7-db0e-11ef-b13d-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"劉昭","people_name_jianti_auto":"刘昭","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"8d3af0cc-db0e-11ef-bf59-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"張守節","people_name_jianti_auto":"张守节","start_index":31,"tongjian_id":"8d3af0cd-db0e-11ef-8efe-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"康","people_name_jianti_auto":"康","start_index":87,"tongjian_id":"8d3af0ce-db0e-11ef-b8bb-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"江夏郡","place_name_jianti_auto":"江夏郡","start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"8d3af0cf-db0e-11ef-8ffe-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"鄳縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"𫑡县","start_index":7,"tongjian_id":"8d3af0d0-db0e-11ef-b8ff-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"冥阨之塞","place_name_jianti_auto":"冥阨之塞","start_index":11,"tongjian_id":"8d3af0d1-db0e-11ef-883b-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"黽阨之塞","place_name_jianti_auto":"黾阨之塞","place_note":"河南信陽西南平靖關","start_index":23,"tongjian_id":"8d3a